---
// Blog section — placeholder for now
---
<style>
  .blog { padding: var(--section-normal) 0; }
  .blog-header { margin-bottom: 3.5rem; }
  .blog-empty {
    padding: 3rem 0;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .blog-empty p {
    font-family: 'Instrument Serif', serif;
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    font-weight: 400;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 2;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
  }
</style>

<section class="blog" id="blog">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="blog-header" data-reveal>
      <div class="section-label">Blog</div>
      <h2 class="section-title">写下来的东西</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="blog-empty" data-reveal>
      <p>种子还在土里。<br/>等它长出来。</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
